SUMMARY: WINTER WISHES pARTy - A Studio Sale of Art & Artisan Wares
DESCRIPTION:Brown County Art Guild\n\nWinter Wishes pARTy\n\nA Studio Sal
 e of Art & Artisan Wares\n\nNew Exhibitions\n\nSaturday November 21\,2026
 \n\n1-4 pm\n\n3pm Annual Raffle drawing for Allen Hutton painting\n\nThe 
 Art Guild has a long tradition of supporting Indiana’s vibrant art scene.
  What better way to celebrate than by showcasing the work of the Guild ar
 tists\, new exhibitions and Guild artisans at a special event just in tim
 e for the holidays. Come and explore dozens of beautiful\, handcrafted tr
 easures throughout the gallery—perfect for gifting or collecting!\n\n----
 -------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ----------------------\n\nBrown County Art Guild – A not for profit organ
 ization located in the heart of downtown Nashville\, Indiana. On display 
 throughout its galleries is a prized collection of historic paintings as 
 well as current works for sale from regional award-winning member artists
 . Also offered throughout the year are artist demonstrations\, workshops\
 , and special exhibits.\n\nGallery hours March through December 2026: Mon
 day – Saturday\, 11 – 5 and Sunday\, 12 – 4\n\nWinter Hours: January & Fe
 bruary 2027: Monday – Wednesday Closed\, Thursday - Saturday 11 - 5 and S
 unday 12 - 4\n\nIf you would like additional information\, please call 81
 2.988.6185 or view our website https://browncountyartguild.org/ https://b
 rowncountyartguild.org/
CATEGORIES:Free,Exhibition,Nashville,Visual-Arts
