  through Thursday from 12-1 in the main floor lobby. Please reserve a 15 m
 inute time slot in CSO during the morning hours.</p><p>  Drop-ins are inte
 nded for basic questions. Schedule a regular appointment on CareerNet with
  your advisor for more substantive questions.&#160\;</p>
