DESCRIPTION:Holiday Micro Sessions at Rivers and Roads 🎄\nJoin Michelle
  Craig Photography at Rivers and Roads in Brown County on\nSmall Business 
 Saturday\, November 28\, from 10 AM–2 PM\nfor a quick and festive holida
 y portrait experience.\nSessions are 5-10 minutes and $59\, accommodating 
 up to 4 people.\nWell-behaved dogs are welcome!\nEach session includes a p
 rivate online gallery and one high-resolution digital download\,\nwith add
 itional digital images\, fine art prints\, and holiday ornaments available
  for purchase\nin a private gallery shop.\nBringing a bigger crew? Please 
 book two consecutive sessions for groups of 5–8 people.\nThese will go q
 uickly so grab your spot now and let’s make a little holiday magic!\n\n
