 ransforming how government organizations access information\, analyze data
 \, and make decisions. But successfully adopting AI\, particularly in nati
 onal security\, requires more than technology.</p><p dir="ltr" data-path-t
 o-node="11">  Drawing on his experience supporting the Department of War's
  War Data Platform\, <strong data-path-to-node="11" data-index-in-node="80
 ">David Kalishman</strong> will explore how government organizations are p
 utting responsible AI governance into practice through three foundational 
