 e the publicly available <strong data-path-to-node="13" data-index-in-node
 ="55">CDAO Responsible AI Toolkit</strong> as a real-world example of oper
 ationalizing responsible AI principles. To make the session interactive\, 
 students will participate in a short hands-on exercise evaluating a hypoth
 etical government AI use case\, identifying risks\, and recommending safeg
