 s and art spaces on campus. A collaboration with the Indiana Memorial Unio
 n onLight Up the Nightwill bring an expanded wintertime market to the annu
 al event along with arts activities\, performances\, ice skating\, and the
  candle-lighting ceremony. The schedule also includes arts programming at 
 theEskenazi Museum of Artand extended hours at theGrunwald Gallery. For th
 e full list of locations\, activities\, and details\, please visitgo.iu.ed
 u/first-thursdays.
