DESCRIPTION:Explore practical stress-management techniques while learning 
 how mental health impacts different communities\, how social inequalities
  affect access to support\, and why inclusive mental wellness matters for
  everyone. Set some personal stress strategy goals and get a free squishy
 !\nAll Indiana University events\, groups\, activities\, and educational\
