 cative ritual that ends with Evelyn's punishment and pleasure. As Cynthia
  yearns for a more conventional relationship\, Evelyn's obsession with er
 otica quickly becomes an addiction that may push the relationship to a br
 eaking point. [104 min\; romance\, drama\; English]
