X-SOURCE-ID:bloomspinweave
X-SOURCE:Bloomington Spinners & Weavers Guild
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261206T123000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261206T170000
