DESCRIPTION:<p dir="ltr">Bloomington Mayor Kerry Thomson will host the fin
 al Traveling Town Hall of 2026 on Monday\, Dec. 7\, from 7 to 8 p.m. at St
 . Thomas Lutheran Church\, 3800 E. Third Street.</p><p dir="ltr">Mayor Tho
 mson will be joined by Jane Kupersmith\, director of Economic and Sustaina
 ble Development\, and City Councilmember Hopi Stosberg.</p><p dir="ltr">Tr
 aveling Town Halls give residents an opportunity to connect directly with 
 City leaders\, ask questions\, share their perspectives and discuss City p
 rojects\, initiatives and neighborhood priorities. Residents from across B
 loomington are encouraged to attend.</p><p dir="ltr">The event will be bro
 adcast live on Community Access Television Services (CATS) and available f
 or on-demand viewing at <a href="http://catstv.net"><b><u>catstv.net</u></
 b></a>.</p>
