X-SOURCE-URLS:{"IU Arts & Humanities Institute": "https://events.iu.edu/live/events/2143431-the-declaration-of-independence-the-motives-the", "IU Bloomington Libraries": "https://events.iu.edu/libraries/event/2299802-the-declaration-of-independence-the-motives-the"}
