BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Browncounty": "https://browncounty.com/events/an-evening-with-haunted-like-human/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:browncounty
SUMMARY:An Evening with Haunted Like Human
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T000000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T020000
DTSTAMP:20261117T143110Z
UID:MEC-f7364884de744d844e2d35cf0f0b8c10@browncounty.com
RECURRENCE-ID;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261211T000000
SEQUENCE:3
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 11/HLH_New_Promo.jpeg
CATEGORIES:Entertainment,Free,Live Music
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20261117
DESCRIPTION:Free Show! Music from 7-9\nNashville\, TN duo Haunted Like Hum
 an delves into inspired songwriting\, sparse arrangements\, and frisson-in
 ducing harmonies that mark their music. With a background in poetry and pr
 ose\, Dale Chapman’s granular focus on language is simpatico with Cody C
 lark’s background in classical guitar\, where each note carries its own 
 weight. Limned with nostalgia\, soaked in Southern gothic lore\, the duo m
 eticulously assembles songs to preserve the spirit of the stories they tel
 l.\nPraise for their new album American Mythology:\n-“Proof that contemp
 orary Americana still knows how to articulate\, with rare sensitivity\, th
 e almost imperceptible scars that time leaves us.” – Music For All\n-
 “Haunted Like Human build their characters and settings so clearly that 
 the mood-inducing magic of the music makes you feel that you’re witnessi
 ng storytelling as focused on American soil as upon our long\, shared huma
 n history.” – Americana Highways\n-“Through its piercing limericks a
 bout human existence in all its shades\, from downtrodden tumbleweeds to l
 ove-strewn epics\, the record arrives at a time when everything feels so h
 opeless. It’s within their art that you can discover slivers of hope tha
 t can reignite the thirst for living.” – Rainbow Rodeo\n
LAST-MODIFIED:20261117
LOCATION:51 IN-46\, Nashville\, IN
ORGANIZER;CN="Brown County Inn":MAILTO:info@browncountyinn.com
PRIORITY:5
TRANSP:OPAQUE
URL:https://browncounty.com/events/an-evening-with-haunted-like-human/
X-SOURCE:Brown County Events
END:VEVENT
