 ps://iu.zoom.us/j/89765842070. (https://iu.zoom.us/j/89765842070.)  An opt
 ional lab tour follows at 10 am\; to make sure we can accommodate everyone
 \, please sign up for the tour here: https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu/o
 nline/form/authen/mschkixtour (https://iubmsch-fireform.eas.iu.edu/online/
 form/authen/mschkixtour)&#160\;This Week's Topic: Embodied Dramaturgies: E
 xploring Motion Capture and Virtual Production as Tools for the Transmissi
 on of Collective Performance KnowledgePresenter: Ana Candida Carneiro  No 
 registration is required to attend. Subscribe to our announcements list to
  receive details for each week's session:&#160\;https://list.iu.edu/sympa/
 subscribe/kix-lab-announcements-l (https://list.iu.edu/sympa/subscribe/kix
 -lab-announcements-l)&#160\;
