SUMMARY:Learn to Knit Cables with April Jennings
DESCRIPTION:December 12\, 2026\, 12-4 PM \nLearn the basics of cable knitting\, reading cable charts\, and using a cable needle. \nWhile no specific project is made\, you will learn what is needed to knit your own cable project! \nThis is a beginner workshop\, but students need to know how to cast-on stitches\, knit\, and purl. \nStudents will provide their own materials. \n3-6 students. \nRegister here.
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/learn-to-knit-cables-with-april-jennings
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
