DESCRIPTION:IUPAI proudly presents our newest exhibition "Behind Gray Wall
 s\," showcasing students' artwork and writing produced over the last year.
  Our opening reception is on December 4th from 5-8 pm during Gallery Walk.
   Larissa Danielle taught two visual art courses\, both in the summers of 
 2025 and 2026 respectively. We will feature 6 physical paintings from her 
 latest class!  Kenny Mitchell taught a creative writing course in Spring 2
 026. Three original works written by his students will be presented throug
 h a listening booth separate from the art exhibit.  Monetary donations wil
 l be accepted at the opening reception. A talk will be given by IUPAI's Pr
 ogram Coordinator\, David Bandera. Food and drink will be provided! Be sur
 e to attend and offer your support!
