SUMMARY:Chunky Blanket Workshop
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261217T220000
DTSTAMP:20260915T160734Z
UID:MEC-051c3b2362f356078f3b4984c129c35b@browncounty.com__20261217
SEQUENCE:1
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://browncounty.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/
 09/Fall26_OLW_Chunky_Blanket_small.jpg
CATEGORIES:Art Events &amp\; Exhibits,Classes &amp\; Workshops
CLASS:PUBLIC
CREATED:20260915
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to hand knit these super soft chunky knit blankets
 . Make a cozy little lap blanket that’s about 3’ x 3’ and leave with
  the know-how to make your own! They’re the perfect addition to your hom
 e decor. Book ahead for this experience. Your blanket could take anywhere
  from 1 1/2 hours to 2 hours to make. Yarn color options vary based on ava
 ilability.\n
