SEQUENCE:1
CREATED:20221219T200215Z
DESCRIPTION:Discardia Mending-Day meets at the Monroe County Public Librar
 y\, 303 East Kirkwood\, monthly on 2nd Saturdays from noon to 4pm. Bring y
 our sewing\, interest in sewing\, interest to learn\, willingness to teach
 \, or just bring pre-washed fabric items in need of mending or alteration!
  We fix and alter garments and other fabric items for free\, as a service 
 to the greater community\, for fun! Let's keep things useful and out of th
 e landfill together!
LAST-MODIFIED:20221219T200332Z
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:OPAQUE
X-SOURCE:B-Square: Misc Civic Events
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Gcal E1Egkmmhjj98Nf0Rgd2Oa4U3Ng": "https://letsgo.terrorware.com/"}
X-SOURCE-ID:gcal_e1egkmmhjj98nf0rgd2oa4u3ng
URL:https://letsgo.terrorware.com/
SUMMARY:Bike Project Open Hours
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20270109T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20270109T150000
DTSTAMP:20261121T064830Z
UID:kdmnorr2h678rac92atfs95030_R20200718T160000@google.com__20270109
SEQUENCE:2
CREATED:20081013T165354Z
DESCRIPTION:<br><b><i>The Community Bike Project is open with limited hour
 s on Saturdays. Hit up their FB page for more up to date info!</i></b><br>
 &nbsp\;The Community Bike Project is a Bloomington-based organization that
  focuses on providing bike transportation to the people of the city. We fo
 cus on teaching bicycle maintenence in order to ensure that bikes on the s
 treets stay on the streets. Here is what we do: Community Bike Project Fro
 nt Door<br><br><br>&nbsp\; &nbsp\; &nbsp\;* bikes for sale: we sell gently
  used bikes at bargain prices<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* ear
 n-a-bike program: participants can receive a bicycle after volunteering th
 eir time in our shop<br><br><br>&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;&nbsp\;* advocacy: we
