 on-arts-student
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  IUPAI proudly presents our newest exhibi
 tion "Behind Gray Walls\," showcasing students' artwork and writing produc
 ed over the last year. Our opening reception is on December 4th from 5-8 p
 m during Gallery Walk.</p><p>  Larissa Danielle taught two visual art cour
 ses\, both in the summers of 2025 and 2026 respectively. We will feature 6
  physical paintings from her latest class!</p><p>  Kenny Mitchell taught a
  creative writing course in Spring 2026. Three original works written by h
 is students will be presented through a listening booth separate from the 
 art exhibit.</p><p>  Monetary donations will be accepted at the opening re
 ception. A talk will be given by IUPAI's Program Coordinator\, David Bande
 ra. Food and drink will be provided! Be sure to attend and offer your supp
 ort!</p>
