SUMMARY:Beginning Knitting w/April Jennings\, February 2027\, Day 2
DESCRIPTION:Curious about knitting? This beginner-friendly class is the perfect place to start! Learn the fundamentals of knitting in a relaxed and supportive environment. Participants will be introduced to knitting tools and materials\, how to cast on stitches\, basic knit and purl stitches\, reading simple patterns\, and binding off your project.  No prior experience is necessary. \nFor more information and to register\, click here.
