DESCRIPTION:Experience the Washington D.C. Global Policy Program. (https:/
 /hls.indiana.edu/careers/dc-global-policy-program/index.html)  Washington 
 DC Summer Practicum  This eight-week intensive summer program for select s
 tudents puts you in the middle of it all. Spend five days per week at a fu
 ll-time internship and two nights per week in the classroom at our IU head
 quarters at our new IU Capital Campus. This experience cultivates practica
 l professional skills while helping you build the network critical to a su
 ccessful career in Washington\, D.C.✔ Live and learn in the heart of U.S
 . government✔ Build real-world experience and a DC network✔ Explore ag
 encies\, embassies\, and think tanks✔ Have a semester you'll never forge
 t  Build a Network That Lasts    Take advantage of IU's presence in Washin
 gton  Connect with IU alumni working across industries    Attend networkin
 g events and professional panels    Develop relationships that can support
  internships\, job opportunities\, and mentorship    Your career doesn't s
 tart after graduation—it starts here.Open to all undergrad\, master's &a
 mp\; PhD students.Apply Here:https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_bxuc
 ZoEtLdi24a (https://iu.co1.qualtrics.com/jfe/form/SV_bxucZoEtLdi24aW)
