UID:20270219-jeffrey-keller-s-bloomington-debut-1900
DESCRIPTION:Jeffrey Keller is a standup comedian based out of New York Cit
 y known for his sharp wit\, boyish charm\, and a unique sense of humor tha
 t draws from his background in musical theatre and everyday life. Jeffrey 
 brings a hammy edge to his standup\, blending storytelling with impeccable
  timing. As a straight man with an eclectic mix of mainly gay theatre frie
 nds\, he offers a perspective that's both fresh and relatable. Despite his
  punchable face and mullet\, it's his big smile and infectious energy that
  win over audiences every time.
