SUMMARY:Beginning Wheel Spinning with Nelly DeVault
DESCRIPTION:April 17\, 2027\, 1:00-4:00 PM \nIn this class\, students will begin by learning the basics of spinning wheel function and will leave with their own hand-spun yarn!  This class is designed for new beginners\, but any spinners are welcome\, whether you can’t get along with your wheel or want help trouble-shooting any specific spinning issues.  Spinning fibers will be provided.  Please indicate when registering if you will bring your own wheel or borrow one. \nFor more information and to register\, click here.
URL:https://bloomspinweave.org/event/beginning-wheel-spinning-with-nelly-devault-2
CATEGORIES:Bloomington Spinners and Weavers Fiber Arts Guild Calendar
